{
  "info": {
    "name": "GOR Gemilang Condet — Jadwal Real-Time",
    "description": "Collection untuk menguji sistem penjadwalan real-time GOR Gemilang Condet.\n\nPastikan backend berjalan di http://localhost:8080 dengan profil h2test.\n\nUrutan test yang disarankan:\n1. GET Schedule (lihat jadwal kosong)\n2. POST Book Court (booking sebuah slot)\n3. GET Schedule lagi (verifikasi slot berubah)\n4. DELETE Cancel Booking (batalkan)\n5. GET Schedule lagi (verifikasi slot kembali available)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "today",
      "value": "2026-03-04",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bookingId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Otomatis terisi saat POST Book Court dijalankan"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📅 Schedule",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Schedule — Hari Ini",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Response punya timeSlots', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('date');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('timeSlots');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.timeSlots).to.be.an('array').and.have.lengthOf(16);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Setiap baris punya 6 slot', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    json.timeSlots.forEach(row => {",
                  "        pm.expect(row.slots).to.have.lengthOf(6);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/schedule?date={{today}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "schedule"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{today}}",
                  "description": "Format: yyyy-MM-dd. Kosongkan untuk default hari ini."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ambil jadwal lengkap untuk tanggal tertentu.\n\nMengembalikan grid 16 baris (07:00–22:00) × 6 kolom (Court 1–6).\n\nStatus slot:\n- AVAILABLE → slot bisa dipesan\n- BOOKED → slot sudah terisi (PENDING atau CONFIRMED)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Schedule — Tanggal Lain",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/schedule?date=2026-03-05",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "schedule"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "2026-03-05"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Contoh melihat jadwal untuk tanggal berbeda (besok)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Schedule — Tanpa Parameter (Default Hari Ini)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/schedule",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "schedule"]
            },
            "description": "Tanpa parameter date → otomatis menggunakan tanggal hari ini."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🎯 Booking (Test Simulasi)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Book Court — Court 3 Jam 10:00",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Response punya booking ID', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.equal('CONFIRMED');",
                  "    // Simpan ID ke collection variable untuk dipakai di request DELETE",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingId', json.id);",
                  "    console.log('Booking ID disimpan:', json.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"courtId\": 3,\n  \"date\": \"{{today}}\",\n  \"time\": \"10:00\",\n  \"customerName\": \"Budi Santoso\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book"]
            },
            "description": "Buat booking baru untuk Court 3 jam 10:00.\n\nSetelah request ini:\n1. Booking tersimpan di database dengan status CONFIRMED\n2. WebSocket broadcast dikirim ke semua client yang subscribe\n3. bookingId otomatis tersimpan ke collection variable\n\nField yang diperlukan:\n- courtId: 1–6\n- date: format yyyy-MM-dd\n- time: format HH:mm (07:00 s/d 22:00)\n- customerName: nama pemesan"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Book Court — Court 1 Jam 14:00",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"courtId\": 1,\n  \"date\": \"{{today}}\",\n  \"time\": \"14:00\",\n  \"customerName\": \"Siti Rahayu\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book"]
            },
            "description": "Booking kedua — Court 1 jam 14:00 atas nama Siti Rahayu."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Book Court — CONFLICT (Slot Sudah Dipakai)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 409 Conflict (slot sudah dipesan)', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Error message ada', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('error');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"courtId\": 3,\n  \"date\": \"{{today}}\",\n  \"time\": \"10:00\",\n  \"customerName\": \"Orang Lain\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book"]
            },
            "description": "Coba booking slot yang sama dengan yang sudah terisi.\n\nHarus mengembalikan 409 Conflict dengan pesan error."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Book Court — Court Tidak Valid (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 Bad Request', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"courtId\": 99,\n  \"date\": \"{{today}}\",\n  \"time\": \"10:00\",\n  \"customerName\": \"Test User\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book"]
            },
            "description": "Court ID 99 tidak ada di database. Harus mengembalikan 400 Bad Request."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Cancel Booking (Pakai bookingId dari POST)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Response konfirmasi cancel', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.message).to.include('dibatalkan');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book/{{bookingId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book", "{{bookingId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Batalkan booking berdasarkan ID.\n\nbookingId otomatis terisi dari hasil POST sebelumnya.\n\nSetelah request ini:\n1. Status booking berubah ke CANCELLED di database\n2. WebSocket broadcast dikirim → slot kembali AVAILABLE"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Cancel — ID Tidak Ada (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404 Not Found', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/book/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "test", "book", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
            },
            "description": "Cancel dengan UUID yang tidak ada di database. Harus mengembalikan 404."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔬 Verifikasi DB (H2 Console)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET H2 Console (buka di browser)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/h2-console",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["h2-console"]
            },
            "description": "Buka H2 Console di browser untuk inspect database secara langsung.\n\nKonfigurasi login H2 Console:\n- JDBC URL  : jdbc:h2:mem:gortest\n- User Name : sa\n- Password  : (kosong)\n\nSQL yang berguna:\nSELECT * FROM BOOKINGS;\nSELECT * FROM COURTS;\nSELECT b.*, c.NAME as COURT_NAME FROM BOOKINGS b JOIN COURTS c ON b.COURT_ID = c.ID ORDER BY b.BOOKING_DATE, b.START_TIME;"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
